  "description": {
   "en": "A full-scale table tennis story, Love All!!\nThere was a time when Japan dominated the table tennis world.\nInthat era, when many world champions were born,\nthe champions held a racket named after the country, the Japanese-style penholder, commonly known as the Nippon Pen.\nWith changes in tactics and the rise of new rackets, the Nippon\nPen has almost disappeared from the international stage,\nandin modern times it has even been called outdated.\nWith that racket, the Nippon Pen, in hand, he will once again reach the top of the table tennis world!\nThat was the dream of Asahi Ogimura, a boy who met a girl named Suzu and started playing table tennis.\nHowever, Asahi drifted away from the world of table tennis due to a certain incident.\nFour years later, an encounter that makes Asahi decide to pursue his dream again...\nA full-scale table tennis story in which he aims to reach the top of the world with the Nippon Pen in hand!!"
  },
